{
    "title": "Blood Sugar - Diabetes App",
    "description": "Blood Sugar App makes it easy and fast to record, monitor blood glucose, and manage your diabetes!\r\n\r\nOur app can make a quick analysis of your blood glucose levels and help you understand the meaning of measurement values. With just one tap, you can convert your blood sugar units (mg/dL, mmol/L). Besides, you will be able to master your health timely by tracking the evolutionary trend of blood sugar.\r\n\r\nAs your one-stop blood health companion, we\u2019ve got scientific knowledge and advice for you to prevent diabetes and keep healthy.\r\n\r\n<b>Key Features for You:</b>\r\n \ud83d\udcdd Easy to log, track and monitor your blood glucose levels\r\n \ud83d\udd0d Blood glucose readings analysis to tell if you are healthy\r\n \ud83d\udcc9 Clear charts help you monitor blood glucose and also useful to detect abnormalities in glycohemoglobin\r\n \ud83c\udff7 Customized tags addable to each record to distinguish every measurement state (before/after a meal, fasting, taking insulin, etc.)\r\n \ud83d\udcd6 Useful blood glucose knowledge and health advice for managing diabetes\r\n \ud83d\udce4 Quick historical reports exporting to share directly with your doctor \r\n \u2601\ufe0f Data backup securely even when changing device\r\n \ud83d\udd04 Use or switch two different blood glucose level units (mg/dl or mmol/l)\r\n\r\n<b>Record Blood Sugar Easily</b>\r\nNo paper and pen are required. Record your blood glucose readings anytime, anywhere. \r\nYou can add any tags you want to make notes of measurement states in detail (before/after a meal, drugs, mood, etc.), which helps you manage diabetes better.\r\n \r\n<b>Clear Graphs to Monitor Blood Sugar</b>\r\nWith the help of clear graphs, you can look over your blood sugar history at a glance and review changes easily.\r\nObserve abnormal trends quickly and take action in time to avoid hypers or hypos and improve your current health.\r\n \r\n<b>Rich Blood Sugar Knowledge for Health</b>\r\nThe app offers you comprehensive health knowledge for blood sugar and expert advice to prevent or control diabetes (Type 1, Type 2, or gestational diabetes).\r\nIt is helpful for you to reduce your worries about diabetes treatment and develop a healthy lifestyle.\r\n\r\n<b>Safely Backup All Records</b>\r\nThere is no worry about losing your data when switching to another device. Sync and restore all your records with one click.  \r\nBy exporting all records, it will be convenient to provide your doctor with blood glucose data.\r\n\r\nDownload the app right now! You can find it easier to log, analyze and control your blood glucose. The app can be used as a blood sugar assistant to help you know your health condition and avoid or control diabetes better. \r\nLet us lead you to reach the target blood sugar level step by step and bring you a healthy body and happiness.\r\n\r\n<b>Disclaimer:</b>\r\nPlease note that this app does not measure your blood sugar, but only serves as an aid to help you keep track of blood sugar and control diabetes.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Blood Sugar App makes it easy and fast to record, monitor blood glucose, and manage your diabetes!<br><br>Our app can make a quick analysis of your blood glucose levels and help you understand the meaning of measurement values. With just one tap, you can convert your blood sugar units (mg/dL, mmol/L). Besides, you will be able to master your health timely by tracking the evolutionary trend of blood sugar.<br><br>As your one-stop blood health companion, we\u2019ve got scientific knowledge and advice for you to prevent diabetes and keep healthy.<br><br><b>Key Features for You:</b><br> \ud83d\udcdd Easy to log, track and monitor your blood glucose levels<br> \ud83d\udd0d Blood glucose readings analysis to tell if you are healthy<br> \ud83d\udcc9 Clear charts help you monitor blood glucose and also useful to detect abnormalities in glycohemoglobin<br> \ud83c\udff7 Customized tags addable to each record to distinguish every measurement state (before/after a meal, fasting, taking insulin, etc.)<br> \ud83d\udcd6 Useful blood glucose knowledge and health advice for managing diabetes<br> \ud83d\udce4 Quick historical reports exporting to share directly with your doctor <br> \u2601\ufe0f Data backup securely even when changing device<br> \ud83d\udd04 Use or switch two different blood glucose level units (mg/dl or mmol/l)<br><br><b>Record Blood Sugar Easily</b><br>No paper and pen are required. Record your blood glucose readings anytime, anywhere. <br>You can add any tags you want to make notes of measurement states in detail (before/after a meal, drugs, mood, etc.), which helps you manage diabetes better.<br> <br><b>Clear Graphs to Monitor Blood Sugar</b><br>With the help of clear graphs, you can look over your blood sugar history at a glance and review changes easily.<br>Observe abnormal trends quickly and take action in time to avoid hypers or hypos and improve your current health.<br> <br><b>Rich Blood Sugar Knowledge for Health</b><br>The app offers you comprehensive health knowledge for blood sugar and expert advice to prevent or control diabetes (Type 1, Type 2, or gestational diabetes).<br>It is helpful for you to reduce your worries about diabetes treatment and develop a healthy lifestyle.<br><br><b>Safely Backup All Records</b><br>There is no worry about losing your data when switching to another device. Sync and restore all your records with one click.  <br>By exporting all records, it will be convenient to provide your doctor with blood glucose data.<br><br>Download the app right now! You can find it easier to log, analyze and control your blood glucose. The app can be used as a blood sugar assistant to help you know your health condition and avoid or control diabetes better. <br>Let us lead you to reach the target blood sugar level step by step and bring you a healthy body and happiness.<br><br><b>Disclaimer:</b><br>Please note that this app does not measure your blood sugar, but only serves as an aid to help you keep track of blood sugar and control diabetes.",
